# project new <folder> fails when the folder exists and is not empty; project init does not (F-TLS-23)
** spec: semantics/project-layout.md
** The runner calls the command of the VM, not this script. "." is the folder of the test, which holds this file.
primary aspect e55_project_new_not_empty is
  process main is
    print "e55: the command project new is tested, not this script";
  return;
end e55_project_new_not_empty;
/*@expect
{
  "command": ["--project", "new", "."],
  "exit": 73,
  "contains": ["project: . exists and is not empty (project init keeps its files)"]
}
*/
